────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
一、允许的行为 / Permitted
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

1. 访问与浏览：任何人可公开访问本仓库及其线上演示站，阅读源码与文档。
   Access: anyone may publicly access this repository and its live demo, and read the code and docs.

2. 本地运行：可为个人学习、教学演示、技术评审、竞赛评审之目的克隆或下载本项目，并在本地
   运行、调试，包括修改本地配置文件（如 .env）以适配自己的环境。
   Local use: you may clone or download the Project and run it locally for personal study,
   teaching demos, technical review or competition judging, including editing local config files.

3. 引用：可在文章、答辩、评审材料中引用本项目的截图、界面与结论，须注明来源与作者。
   Citation: you may cite screenshots, UI and findings from the Project with attribution.

4. 评审与验收：赛事主办方、评委、教师可为评审目的访问、部署与运行本项目。
   Evaluation: organizers, judges and instructors may access, deploy and run the Project for review.

────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
二、禁止的行为 / Prohibited
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

1. 商业使用：不得将本项目（含全部或部分代码、素材、文档）用于任何直接或间接获取经济利益的
   场景，包括但不限于：付费产品、付费部署或托管服务、SaaS 对外提供、收费培训、企业内部生产
   系统、以本项目为基础承接商业项目。
   Commercial use: no use of the Project, in whole or in part, for any direct or indirect
   commercial advantage, including paid products, paid hosting, SaaS offerings, paid training,
   internal production systems, or client work built on the Project.

2. 再分发：不得以任何形式公开分发本项目的源码或衍生作品，包括但不限于：公开 fork、镜像仓库、
   打包上传至其他托管平台、发布到包管理器、以压缩包形式对外提供。
   Redistribution: no public redistribution of the source code or derivative works in any form,
   including public forks, mirrors, uploads to other hosting platforms or package registries.

3. 二次投稿：不得将本项目的全部或部分（包括改名、换皮、重构、翻译、局部抽取模块、替换前端或
   后端后复用核心逻辑）作为自己的作品或成果，提交至任何竞赛、评奖、评选、课程作业、毕业设计、
   招标、创业项目申报或类似活动。
   Re-submission: no use of the Project, in whole or in part (including renaming, re-skinning,
   refactoring, translation, extracting modules, or reusing core logic behind a replaced frontend
   or backend), as one's own work for any competition, award, course assignment, thesis, tender,
   startup application or similar activity.

4. 去除标识：不得移除、隐藏或篡改本许可、版权声明与作者署名。
   No removal or concealment of this License, copyright notices or attribution.

5. 署名暗示：不得使用项目名称或作者标识暗示获得作者背书、合作或授权。
   No use of the project name or author identity to imply endorsement, partnership or authorization.

6. 衍生作品公开：基于本项目修改产生的版本，仅可用于第一条所列的个人本地用途，不得公开。
   Derivatives: modified versions may only be used locally as permitted in Section 1, and must not
   be made public.

